# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺投資或者買賣入面，當價格跌到某個程度就賣出，以免損失再擴大（量詞：次）
eng:stop loss; cut losses
<eg>
yue:佢見股價跌得犀利，即刻止蝕離場。 (keoi5 gin3 gwa2 gaa3 dit3 dak1 sai1 lei6, zik1 hak1 zi2 sik6 lei4 coeng4.)
eng:Seeing the stock price drop sharply, he immediately cut his losses and exited the market. [end of text]


